        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "One of those is a half step under home; the other is a whole step under it. That difference — a leading tone that pulls versus a "
        },
        {
          "text": "b7",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": " that doesn't — is a half step in the scale but a real difference in how strongly the note wants to move."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
