    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Half steps say where the tension sits next to home. There's one more piece of structure that says where the tension sits inside the scale itself — and unlike the two half steps, there's only one of it."
        }
      ]
    }
